sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Router as context-router
    participant Policy as policy-engine
    participant Memory as memory-manager
    participant TokenOpt as token-budget-optimizer
    participant Assembler as context-assembler

    Client->>Router: POST /v1/context/route
    Router->>Policy: EvaluateTenantAccess(TenantID)
    Policy-->>Router: Access Allowed (Rules ACK)
    Router->>Memory: GetSessionStatePointer(SessionID)
    Memory-->>Router: Session Active (Pointer Data)
    Router->>TokenOpt: EstimateMass(Payload + State)
    TokenOpt-->>Router: Token Count = 14,200
    Router->>Router: Execute Route Decision Algorithm
    Router->>Assembler: SubmitRoutePlan(PlanSpec)
    Assembler-->>Router: Plan Accepted (JobID)
    Router-->>Client: 200 OK (RoutePlanResult)